{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.KashaevVolumeConjecture","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.KashaevVolumeConjecture","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.PhiQPiece"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.borromean_volume_from_vc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.borromean_volume_from_vc","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L148-L156","doc":"**CONDITIONAL** (from `kvc_holds`). If VC holds, the Borromean braid's\nhyperbolic volume equals its Kashaev limit. (The value `Vol(B₃)=8·G`,\n`G` = Catalan's constant — entering the proton mass formula via the\nBorromean Markov trace — is cited, not derived.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.figure_eight_volume_from_vc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.figure_eight_volume_from_vc","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L138-L146","doc":"**CONDITIONAL** (from `kvc_holds`). If the Volume Conjecture holds, the\nfigure-eight braid's hyperbolic volume equals its Kashaev limit. (The value\n`Vol(4₁)=2·Cl₂(π/3)=6·Λ(π/3)≈2.029883` — connecting to `m_μ/m_e = Vol(4₁)/ℏ_q²` — is the\nAndersen–Hansen theorem, cited, not derived from the abstract class.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.borromeanBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.borromeanBraid","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L132-L136","doc":"Borromean braid `B₃` = closure of `(σ₀σ₁⁻¹)³` on 3 strands. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.fourOneBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.fourOneBraid","kind":"def","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L126-L130","doc":"Figure-eight braid `4₁` = closure of `(σ₀σ₁⁻¹)²` on 3 strands\n(`Bool = true` marks a negative crossing). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.pieceVolume_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.pieceVolume_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L94-L103","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.pieceVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.pieceVolume","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L72-L92","doc":"The hyperbolic volume of a Φ_q-piece `K_S`, lifted from the\ntypeclass.  This is the canonical bridge between the abstract\n`SubLink.hypVolume` field on the geometry side and the typeclass\n`VolumeConjecture.hypVolume` on the analysis side: any concrete\ninstance of `VolumeConjecture` populates a real value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.PieceVolumeConjecture.pieceVolume_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.PieceVolumeConjecture.pieceVolume_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L70-L70","doc":"The piece volume is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.PieceVolumeConjecture.pieceVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.PieceVolumeConjecture.pieceVolume","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L68-L68","doc":"The piece volume function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.PieceVolumeConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.PieceVolumeConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L66-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.PieceVolumeConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.PieceVolumeConjecture","kind":"class","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L65-L70","doc":"**CONJECTURE.** A combinatorial constructor for subLink and its hyperbolic volume. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.kvc_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.kvc_holds","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L63-L63","doc":"**The conjecture itself**: the Kashaev limit equals the\nhyperbolic volume.  This is the field that plays the role\nof `sorry` for KVC. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.hypVolume_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.hypVolume_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Hyperbolic volume is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.kashaevLimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.kashaevLimit","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The Kashaev asymptotic limit `2π · lim_N log|J_N(K)| / N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.hypVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.hypVolume","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Hyperbolic volume of `S³ \\ K_β`, with the convention that\nnon-hyperbolic complements contribute zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture","kind":"class","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.lean#L33-L63","doc":"**Kashaev Volume Conjecture (axiomatised).**\n\nEncodes the assertion that the hyperbolic volume of `S³ \\ K`\nequals the Kashaev limit `2π · lim_N log|J_N(K)| / N` of the\ncolored Jones polynomial.\n\nAny instance of this class supplies:\n- `hypVolume β` — the hyperbolic volume of the complement of the\n  closure of `β` (zero when the complement is not hyperbolic).\n- `kashaevLimit β` — the asymptotic limit of the colored Jones\n  polynomial.\n- `kvc_holds β` — the conjecture itself, identifying the two.\n\nThe `kvc_holds` field is the **conjectural input**: providing it\nis the role of mathematicians (not Lean).  Downstream theorems\nconsuming `[VolumeConjecture q]` are conditional on it. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:kashaev-volume-conjecture","label":"conj:kashaev-volume-conjecture","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}